            "Set up. Google reviews are loaded live each time a page with a Reviews block is viewed: one Place Details request on your own key per view, never stored (Google\u2019s terms do not allow keeping them).": [
                "Thi\u1ebft l\u1eadp. \u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 c\u1ee7a Google \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea3i tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp m\u1ed7i khi trang c\u00f3 kh\u1ed1i \u0110\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c xem: m\u1ed9t y\u00eau c\u1ea7u Place Details tr\u00ean kh\u00f3a c\u1ee7a ch\u00ednh b\u1ea1n cho m\u1ed7i l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, kh\u00f4ng bao gi\u1edd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u tr\u1eef (c\u00e1c \u0111i\u1ec1u kho\u1ea3n c\u1ee7a Google kh\u00f4ng cho ph\u00e9p gi\u1eef l\u1ea1i ch\u00fang)."
            ],
            "The first refresh failed: %s": [
